docs {
  # Carousel API
  
  CRUD endpoints untuk manajemen carousel/banner images.
  
  ## Base URL
  `/api/carousel`
  
  ## Endpoints Overview
  
  | Method | Endpoint | Auth | Role | Description |
  |--------|----------|------|------|-------------|
  | GET | / | ❌ | Public | List carousel aktif |
  | GET | /admin | ✅ | Admin | List semua carousel |
  | GET | /:id | ❌ | Public | Detail carousel |
  | POST | / | ✅ | Admin | Buat carousel |
  | PUT | /:id | ✅ | Admin | Update carousel |
  | DELETE | /:id | ✅ | Admin | Hapus carousel |
  
  ## Page Values
  - `capaian` - Halaman capaian
  - `home` - Halaman utama
}
